            "text": "<p>The nurtured younglings. Chamomile, lavender, frankincense, gardenia, and benzoin, wrapped in beeswax. In the hive, nurse bees tend the brood around the clock, keeping the youngest bees warm and fed. This scent holds that same comfort.</p>",
