            "title": "WORKER",
            "text": "<p>The maiden foragers. Blood orange, grapefruit, coriander, rosemary, black pepper, labdanum, and lemongrass, grounded in beeswax. A forager bee may visit up to 5,000 flowers in a single day, carrying gifts of pollen and nectar back to the hive. This blend captures that vivid, purposeful energy.</p>",
